  "what_happened_next": {
    "text": "Apple gained about two-fifths over five years, while Cisco lost about seven-tenths and Microsoft also fell. Bonds gained while the US basket ended lower. Being in the broad technology industry did not give these three companies the same result. Even Apple’s positive endpoint hid a very rough journey.",
