    ]
  },
  "reflection": {
    "what_people_were_focused_on": "Korean diplomacy, digital music and Microsoft’s court case were prominent. People were also discovering new museums and returning to everyday hobbies.",
    "what_actually_mattered": "Different businesses and asset types mattered more than one broad label such as technology. A portfolio concentrated in a few famous names faced large company risks.",
    "what_faded_away": "The first reaction to a court order did not explain the complete investment result. Neither did the latest online trading tool.",
    "what_nobody_knew": "The precise winners and losses were unknown. An investor could not know in advance how a promising product, a lawsuit or a major world event would affect the final value.",
